@CashFlow.Consolidation_HostAddress = http://localhost:8081
@Keycloak_TokenUrl = http://localhost:9080/realms/cashflow/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Obter token (cashflow-reader: apenas leitura) — execute antes das demais requisições
# @name login
POST {{Keycloak_TokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=cashflow-api&client_secret=cashflow-api-secret&username=cashflow-reader&password=reader123

### Consultar saldo consolidado por data
GET {{CashFlow.Consolidation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/consolidation/2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{CashFlow.Consolidation_HostAddress}}/health
